      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hazel Park’s early growth was spurred by Henry Ford’s Highland Park plant, which attracted workers and led to the first subdivisions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
